          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 1,
          "question": {
            "text": "For the reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></munderover><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mi>Para</mi></mfenced></munder></math>&nbsp;the true statement about the product is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "HDp52",
              "text": "it does not exist as Zwitter ion",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "uFsPx",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;group displays a powerful basic character",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "trMyD",
              "text": "it does not act as inner salt",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "AiVlh",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>,&nbsp;diminishes the basic character of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2fd89102-b824-4df8-abe9-b9abd3157e9b-image.png\" style=\"width: 388px; height: 248px;\" /></p><p>A zwitterion is a compound with no overall electrical charge, but which contains separate parts which are positively and negatively charged.</p><p>Sulphanilic acid exist as dipolar ion (zwitter ion); act as inner salt and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>&nbsp;group diminishes the basic character of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p>",
            "image": null
          },
