            }
          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 1,
          "question": {
            "text": "Maximum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;value is of&nbsp;",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "CUNn7",
              "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/892301c2-dcab-4ce6-9d04-fd5c95c1f201-image.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 155px;\" /></p>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "ojXle",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>NH</mi></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "10UIk",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>NH</mi></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "Fw5aA",
              "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/106826dd-1642-402e-80ef-d0ccfd7f88e9-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 59px;\" /></p>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>Maximum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math> (least basic) is (d) since, lone pair on<br />N-atom is used to delocalise <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math> -electrons on two benzene<br />rings.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/8d2d198b-a01d-4120-96c2-7c4b8d6b9d53-image.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 107px;\" /></p><p>Least basic has maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math>.</p><p>Since, in (d), lone pair of electrons over <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>-atom are delocalised to two benzene rings, thus is least basic.</p>",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
